{"ref":"BDB, מַ֫עַל","hw":"מַ֫עַל","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַ֫עַל</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:2\" href=\"/Ezra.9.2\">Ezr 9:2</a></sup> <strong>unfaithful, treacherous act (</strong>NH <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעִילָה</span><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.15\">Lv 5:15</a> + 16 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מָ֑עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:12\" href=\"/Numbers.5.12\">Nu 5:12</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.20\">Ez 17:20</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.26\">Ez 39:26</a> + 3 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  ag. man: <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׁאר מעל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:34\" href=\"/Job.21.34\">Jb 21:34</a> <em>faithlessness remains</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:12\" href=\"/Numbers.5.12\">Nu 5:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:27\" href=\"/Numbers.5.27\">27</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.10\">Pr 16:10</a> under <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעַל</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  elsewhere ag. God, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:22\" href=\"/Joshua.22.22\">Jos 22:22</a> (P); without <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.1\">1 Ch 9:1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.19\">2 Ch 29:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.19\">33:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:2\" href=\"/Ezra.9.2\">Ezr 9:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:4\" href=\"/Ezra.9.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:6\" href=\"/Ezra.10.6\">10:6</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">מַעַל</span> elsewhere only c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעַל</span> q.v. (<strong>1</strong>; all cited).","next":"BDB, מְעִיל²","prev":"BDB, מָעַל"}